# 6. Configuration du Firewall

## 1) Politique DROP

```bash
sudo iptables -P INPUT DROP
sudo iptables -P OUTPUT DROP
sudo iptables -P FORWARD DROP
```

![Activation firewall](imageTP2-P2/img14.png)

---

## 2) Autorisation ICMP

```bash
sudo iptables -A INPUT -p icmp -j ACCEPT
sudo iptables -A OUTPUT -p icmp -j ACCEPT
```

![Règles ICMP](imageTP2-P2/img16.png)

---

## 3) Autorisation port 8888

```bash
sudo iptables -A INPUT -p tcp --dport 8888 -j ACCEPT
sudo iptables -A OUTPUT -p tcp --sport 8888 -j ACCEPT
```

![Ouverture port 8888](imageTP2-P2/img7.png)

---

## 4) Vérification des règles

```bash
sudo iptables -L -n -v
```

![Liste règles iptables](imageTP2-P2/img17.png)

